  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen creating a new Color Palette you would expect it to start with the default values of the VRChat Menu.\n\nThis is not the case though, the default colors of a new Color Palette are not the same colors as the actual VRChat default colors.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Open the UI Theme Settings  \n\n2. Select the Default Theme\n\n3. Create a new Color Palette and don't change anything  \n\n4. Save & Apply the new Color Palette\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the colors aren't the same as the actual default anymore.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe default colors of a new Color Palette should be the exact same colors as the actual VRChat default colors to make it easier for people to just tweak them a bit.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/wlhr10.mp4",
